@startuml sequencia_trocar_moedas
title UC06 — Trocar moedas

participant Frontend
participant ResgateController
participant ResgateService
participant "Aluno" as AlunoClasse
participant "Banco de dados" as BD
participant EmailService

Frontend -> ResgateController : POST /vantagens/{id}/resgatar
ResgateController -> ResgateService : resgatar(alunoId, vantagemId)
ResgateService -> BD : buscar aluno e vantagem
BD --> ResgateService : aluno, vantagem
ResgateService -> ResgateService : validar vantagem ativa e saldo
ResgateService -> AlunoClasse : conta.debitar(custoMoedas)
AlunoClasse --> ResgateService : saldo atualizado
ResgateService -> BD : salvar conta e registrar resgate (código do cupom)
BD --> ResgateService : ok
ResgateService -> EmailService : notificarResgate()
ResgateService --> ResgateController : resgate (código do cupom)
ResgateController --> Frontend : 201 Created
@enduml
